      "message": "fix(setup): the rest chain follows the stock source; merge main (#318)\n\n#318's rest::across::chain_of now meets carry::Entry::NewBlock: \"Its own\nstock\" in a different hold breaks the rest chain exactly like the clip,\nso a rest pass on a new block never reads the earlier setup's cuts. An\nexplicit \"What Setup1 leaves behind\" on a same-held unlinked setup\ncarries in rest as in the sim. across.rs's \"not stated until #320\" law\nnow names the pick. The setup sheet's format strings use \\n escapes.\n\nPinned by rest_across_setups::a_turned_setup_picked_its_own_stock_does_not_read_the_first_setups_cuts\nand ::a_same_held_setup_picked_what_setup1_leaves_reads_its_cuts.\n\nRefs #320\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
